  slides:
  - title: Stampcards
    body: The Ticket Stand is where all stampcards are issued - and you want as many
      stamps as you can get.
  - title: How do I earn?
    body: Everybody in WONDERBLUE has their very own stamp attached to their wristband,
      but they can only give so many before running out of ink!
  - title: Stamps
    body: 'Make friends, socialize, and admire the growing gallery of all your new
      connections with a prize for a completed card! '
