  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InfoPanelScript
  slides:
  - title: The Carp
    body: 'The Carp is a WONDERBLUE''S version of a lazy river!

      Relax in the
      giant orbs of water, and let the flow take you to heights you''d never see
      otherwise!'
  - title: Orbs
    body: 'To enter an orb, simply enter The Carp through the tunnel.


      To
      leave, simply hold SPACEBAR!'
